OL,3,GNEWSAHow to replace one of the world's
OL,4,Abusiest runways - while still using it
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe are waiting for the last plane to
OL,7,Fleave Heathrow.
OL,9,FIt is 10:45 PM and we are in a convoy
OL,10,Fof road maintenance vehicles on the
OL,11,Fedge of the Northern Runway.
OL,13,FWe see the plane take off. The call
OL,14,Fcomes through on the radio and 130
OL,15,Fvehicles head to the tarmac.
OL,17,FThey do not hang about.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
